          "type": "copy",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow_text": "",
            "show_eyebrow_arrow": false,
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>In late 2022, when Kylie was crafting her vision for Khy’s first several collaborations, she was struck by the idea to create a line of fashion-forward-yet-functional outerwear. “There are so few brands who think of puffers from a fashion lens, so it was important to me that we partnered with someone who also shared an innovative, unconventional perspective on this category,” Kylie explains. “I’ve always been a fan of Entire Studios and admire their distinct aesthetic, so it was an easy decision to work with them on this collection.”</p>",
            "horizontal_align_md": "left",
            "horizontal_align": "left",
            "vertical_align_md": "middle",
