          "settings": {
            "eyebrow_text": "",
            "show_eyebrow_arrow": false,
            "title": "<h5><strong>A DISTINCT AESTHETIC</strong></h5>",
            "description": "<p>The LA-based label quickly established wide recognition for their uniquely identifiable designs after New Zealand natives Sebastian Hunt and Dylan Richards-Diaz launched the brand with a single puffer jacket in 2020. Their iconic debut piece sold out instantly, and while the founding duo has expanded their range significantly over the past few years, this original silhouette remains perhaps the most notable representation of Entire Studios’ masterful ability to fuse luxury, modernity, and innovation. <br/><br/>Entire Studios’ design approach to any new collection—which begins at the perceived endpoint of full, styled looks, informing the pieces to be made with the intention of each to be worn with the next—inspired Kylie’s idea to integrate essential, easy-to-style base layers into the collaboration’s assortment. </p>",
            "horizontal_align_md": "left",
            "horizontal_align": "left",
            "vertical_align_md": "middle",
